<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Visão geral do Log Observer on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/3-quick-tour/4-log-observer-home/</link><description>Recent content in Visão geral do Log Observer on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>pt-BR</language><atom:link href="https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/3-quick-tour/4-log-observer-home/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Log Observer Home Page</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/3-quick-tour/4-log-observer-home/1-log-observer-home/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/pt-br/splunk4rookies/observability-cloud/3-quick-tour/4-log-observer-home/1-log-observer-home/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Clique em &lt;strong&gt;Logs&lt;/strong&gt; no menu principal e depois em &lt;strong&gt;Log Observer&lt;/strong&gt;. A página inicial do Log Observer é composta por 4 seções distintas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="figure"&gt;
 &lt;div class="figure__inner"&gt;
 &lt;img src="../images/log-observer-main.png" alt="Página Baixa" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 
&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding Pane:&lt;/strong&gt; Vídeos de treinamento e links para documentação para você começar a usar o Splunk Log Observer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Filter Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Filtre por hora, índices e campos e também salve consultas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logs Table Pane:&lt;/strong&gt; Lista de entradas de log que correspondem aos critérios de filtro atuais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fields Pane:&lt;/strong&gt; Lista de campos disponíveis no índice atualmente selecionado.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
